+# Transport Compression Codec
+
+This project has no recorded decision specifying a transport compression codec. The README lists "Compression" only as a generic category of functionality offered by third-party gin-contrib middleware, and no other document in this repository records a chosen codec, so nothing is currently recorded as the project's decision on this topic.
